{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415230/extras/8d3bc45006efa669aeb56f3e8ad768ac.avif?t=1753564326\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are the owner of your very own Witchcraft Shop! Move between different rooms to take care of your daily tasks and upgrade your store over time. In this fun job simulator, you will be tasked with everyday which-shop tasks! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415230/extras/wbshop.gif?t=1753564326\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415230/extras/77435e09a5af9914c7b3c82446821487.avif?t=1753564326\" /></div>Collect flowers from your garden, meditate, and cast a ritual to gain bonuses for the day. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Check out the swamp to see if you can find an oddity to use in your potions! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415230/extras/wbsanctuary.gif?t=1753564326\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415230/extras/8ab682e06c8eec8f35964f712b9a8432.avif?t=1753564326\" /></div>Make sure you follow the recipes correctly to craft your customers\u2019 orders. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mix ingredients, play mini-games, and create witchy stuff!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415230/extras/2f3f284ed836503d83d8d943ba07672f.avif?t=1753564326\" /></div>Take orders, sell potions, tidy up your counter, convert thieves to frogs! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415230/extras/shop.gif?t=1753564326\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While the business is open, you must be attentive and quick so your customers won\u2019t run out of patience and thieves won\u2019t steal your hard-earned coins.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415230/extras/a74804340a2ad4e46a8e7189d91395cf.avif?t=1753564326\" /></div><strong>Witchy Business Features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Glamorous &amp; bewitching hand-drawn art </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many upgrades to customize your store</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tons of recipes to learn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coven of Witches to meet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eccentric craftables </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415230/extras/e32683b4070c3a3a0b23051d02c17531.avif?t=1753564326\" /></div>Play in the relaxed mode if you are a chill witch or play in the mayhem mode if you are a mean witch that\u2019s looking to get some real coins!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With different characters and customization options, it\u2019s up to you to be the witch that suits you the best. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All witches need cute little cats to guide them through this dark world, make sure to feed them as some have even lower patience than the customers! Looking at you, Lucipurr. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415230/extras/wishlist.png?t=1753564326\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Don't forget to wishlist &quot;Witchy Business&quot; on Steam, press the green button by going up the page \ud83d\udc9c</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3415230?t=1753564326","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3415230?t=1753564326","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415230/b7228700ed8eff12130568ae43319f6046c16aec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753564326","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415230/b7228700ed8eff12130568ae43319f6046c16aec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753564326","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3486270,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Play the Free Demo First!</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415230/extras/wishlist.png?t=1753564326\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415230/extras/8d3bc45006efa669aeb56f3e8ad768ac.avif?t=1753564326\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are the owner of your very own Witchcraft Shop! Move between different rooms to take care of your daily tasks and upgrade your store over time. In this fun job simulator, you will be tasked with everyday which-shop tasks! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415230/extras/wbshop.gif?t=1753564326\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415230/extras/77435e09a5af9914c7b3c82446821487.avif?t=1753564326\" /></div>Collect flowers from your garden, meditate, and cast a ritual to gain bonuses for the day. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Check out the swamp to see if you can find an oddity to use in your potions! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415230/extras/wbsanctuary.gif?t=1753564326\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415230/extras/8ab682e06c8eec8f35964f712b9a8432.avif?t=1753564326\" /></div>Make sure you follow the recipes correctly to craft your customers\u2019 orders. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mix ingredients, play mini-games, and create witchy stuff!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415230/extras/2f3f284ed836503d83d8d943ba07672f.avif?t=1753564326\" /></div>Take orders, sell potions, tidy up your counter, convert thieves to frogs! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415230/extras/shop.gif?t=1753564326\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While the business is open, you must be attentive and quick so your customers won\u2019t run out of patience and thieves won\u2019t steal your hard-earned coins.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415230/extras/a74804340a2ad4e46a8e7189d91395cf.avif?t=1753564326\" /></div><strong>Witchy Business Features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Glamorous &amp; bewitching hand-drawn art </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many upgrades to customize your store</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tons of recipes to learn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coven of Witches to meet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eccentric craftables </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415230/extras/e32683b4070c3a3a0b23051d02c17531.avif?t=1753564326\" /></div>Play in the relaxed mode if you are a chill witch or play in the mayhem mode if you are a mean witch that\u2019s looking to get some real coins!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With different characters and customization options, it\u2019s up to you to be the witch that suits you the best. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All witches need cute little cats to guide them through this dark world, make sure to feed them as some have even lower patience than the customers! Looking at you, Lucipurr. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415230/extras/wishlist.png?t=1753564326\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Don't forget to wishlist &quot;Witchy Business&quot; on Steam, press the green button by going up the page \ud83d\udc9c</strong></p>","developers":["Rogue Duck Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstat